###  https://isotc204.org/25965/transport/transportnetwork#expiryTime
transportnetwork:expiryTime rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty .


###  https://isotc204.org/25965/transport/transportnetwork#from
transportnetwork:from rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty .


